1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:09,000
October 1962. Trapped under heavy depth charges,
Soviet submarine B-59 lost all contact with Moscow.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:18,500
Convinced World War Three had begun, two officers
voted to launch a nuclear torpedo. But one man said NO.

3
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:29,200
Vasili Arkhipov refused authorization.
The sub surfaced, saving humanity from extinction.
